[00:00.000] 作词 : Tyler Sellers/Hunter Valentine
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Tyler Sellers/Hunter Valentine
[00:16.211]it’s hard to speak but your eyes said enough darling
[00:22.054]I feel so weak while clinging on to a precious moment
[00:28.887]and memories of holding you while blood was flowing out
[00:43.298]an antique
[00:45.293]pierced skin mangled hair like fall leaves
[00:49.209]as I move away from your face
[00:53.197]from who you are I hope to see
[00:56.345]that you won’t change
[00:58.310]and love someone the way you loved me
[01:08.584]kiss me in the mortuary
[01:15.230]bury me outside your mind
[01:22.491]kiss me in the mortuary one last time
